          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is RERA registration mandatory for Delhi developers?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Under S.3 RERA 2016, no promoter can advertise or accept advances without RERA registration. Delhi RERA notified 31 Oct 2016. Non-compliance: up to 10% of project cost."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How does RERA escrow work?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "70% of allottee receipts in separate escrow account (S.4(2)(l)(D)). Withdrawals only for land/construction of that project. CA-certified. Quarterly financial statements to Delhi RERA Authority."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the penalty for late RERA compliance?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "S.59 RERA 2016: up to 5% of estimated project cost. Persistent non-compliance: imprisonment up to 3 years or fine up to 10% or both. Quarterly submission is non-negotiable."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is percentage-of-completion method?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Revenue recognised based on proportion of cost incurred vs total estimated cost. Under IND AS 115. Requires accurate WIP tracking and CA-certified cost statements at milestones."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much does construction accounting cost?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Monthly project accounting from Rs 15,000/project. RERA quarterly from Rs 10,000/quarter. GST from Rs 3,000/month. Tax audit from Rs 25,000/year. Statutory audit from Rs 40,000/year."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does setup take?",
