                <p><strong>RERA 2016:</strong> Project registration, 70% escrow (S.4), quarterly statements, CA certification. Delhi notified 31 Oct 2016. Penalty S.59: up to 5% of project cost.</p><p><strong>IND AS 115:</strong> Revenue from Contracts with Customers. POCM for construction. Applicable to companies above Rs 250Cr net worth or listed.</p><p><strong>CGST Act 2017:</strong> 1% affordable (≤60 sq m, <Rs 45L) | 5% non-affordable (no ITC) | 12% commercial (ITC eligible) | Works contract 12%/18%.</p><p><strong>IT Act S.44AB:</strong> Tax audit for turnover >Rs 1Cr. S.194C: TDS on contractor payments 1%/2%.</p><p><strong>Companies Act:</strong> S.135 CSR for net worth >Rs 500Cr / turnover >Rs 1,000Cr / profit >Rs 5Cr.</p>

