                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What GST rate applies to under-construction property in Delhi?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Affordable (≤60 sq m, <Rs 45L): 1% no ITC. Non-affordable residential: 5% no ITC. Commercial: 12% with ITC. Ready-to-move with CC: exempt. Classification must be correct at invoice level.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-2">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Is RERA registration mandatory for Delhi developers?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Yes. Under S.3 RERA 2016, no promoter can advertise or accept advances without RERA registration. Delhi RERA notified 31 Oct 2016. Non-compliance: up to 10% of project cost.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-3">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">How does RERA escrow work?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>70% of allottee receipts in separate escrow account (S.4(2)(l)(D)). Withdrawals only for land/construction of that project. CA-certified. Quarterly financial statements to Delhi RERA Authority.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-4">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What is the penalty for late RERA compliance?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>S.59 RERA 2016: up to 5% of estimated project cost. Persistent non-compliance: imprisonment up to 3 years or fine up to 10% or both. Quarterly submission is non-negotiable.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-5">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What is percentage-of-completion method?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Revenue recognised based on proportion of cost incurred vs total estimated cost. Under IND AS 115. Requires accurate WIP tracking and CA-certified cost statements at milestones.</p></div>
